╔═ mymodule ═╗

□ Node ═╗
║ val ─ INT32
║ next ─ @Node
═╗

/* block comment
   spanning multiple
   lines */
· BIGARR ─ UINT64[64] ─ 0 ◇
· NEG_SCALAR ─ INT64 ─ -7 ◇
· PTR_SCALAR ─ UINT64 ─ &worker ◇

△ worker ○ VOID ═╗
║ → 0 ◇
╚═══ 1 ═══╝

△ big_local ○ VOID ═╗
║ · buf ─ UINT8[300] ─ 0 ◇  // trailing comment after code
║ → 0 ◇
╚═══ 1 ═══╝

△ very_negative ○ VOID ─ INT64 ═╗
║ · x ─ INT64 ─ -4294967297 ◇
║ → x ◇
╚═══ 1 ═══╝

△ node_next ○ n ─ @Node ─ INT32 ═╗
║ → n ─ △ val ◇
╚═══ 1 ═══╝
